{{Tablerow|'''Halo&amp;amp;nbsp;color'''|The color of the halo effect.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Tablerow|'''Intensity&amp;amp;nbsp;scale'''|The overall intensity of the halo effect. This has a multiplicative effect on the halo color.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Tablerow|'''Render&amp;amp;nbsp;width&amp;amp;nbsp;random&amp;amp;nbsp;noise'''|Specifies whether random noise is added to the halo effect. This is useful for eliminating banding artifacts.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|}&lt;br /&gt;
