If the ambient reflection output depends on this process, then the results are undefined.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Process|Object-Space View Direction|Shader_objectview.png|None|3D vector|The unit-length object-space direction to viewer '''V'''.}}&lt;br /&gt;
|-&lt;br /&gt;
{{Process|Object-Space Halfway Direction|Shader_objecthalfway.png|None|3D vector|The unit-length object-space halfway direction '''H'''.&lt;br /&gt;
